      "lines": [
        {
          "side": "me",
          "text": "Hi Marcus, thanks for joining. This is Priya Raman from Lumen Foods. I want to go over the Harbor Logistics renewal today."
        },
        {
          "side": "them",
          "text": "Hi Priya, happy to. Our proposal for next year is forty-eight thousand five hundred dollars a year, for three hundred and forty seats."
        },
        {
          "side": "me",
          "text": "Last year we paid forty-two thousand dollars. That is a big jump. Can you do a twelve percent discount if we sign for two years?"
        },
        {
          "side": "them",
          "text": "I can offer ten percent on a two-year term. So the annual price would be forty-three thousand six hundred and fifty dollars."
        },
        {
          "side": "me",
          "text": "Okay. The other topic is the Rotterdam warehouse. We need it to handle two point five million units by the end of the second quarter."
        },
        {
          "side": "them",
          "text": "Rotterdam can handle that. Our operations lead, Sofia Lindqvist, will send you a capacity plan by Friday, November sixth."
        },
        {
          "side": "me",
          "text": "Great. What about late deliveries? In September we had seventeen late shipments out of nine hundred."
        },
        {
          "side": "them",
          "text": "That was a carrier problem. We have switched carriers, and our on-time rate in October was ninety-eight point four percent."
        },
        {
          "side": "me",
          "text": "Good. Then let's set the go-live date for the new contract to March fourteenth, twenty twenty-seven."
        },
        {
          "side": "them",
          "text": "March fourteenth works. I will send the revised contract to you and to your finance director, Daniel Weiss, by next Wednesday."
        },
        {
          "side": "me",
          "text": "One more question. Is customs clearance included in the price?"
        },
        {
          "side": "them",
          "text": "Customs clearance is included for the European Union. For the United Kingdom there is an extra fee of eighty-five dollars per shipment."
        },
        {
          "side": "me",
          "text": "Understood. So the action items are: Sofia sends the capacity plan by November sixth, you send the contract by Wednesday, and I confirm the two-year term with Daniel."
        },
        {
          "side": "them",
          "text": "That's right. Thanks Priya, talk soon."
        }
      ],
